Inject cursor:
```
await page.addInitScript(() => {
  const cursor = document.createElement('div');
  cursor.id = 'pw-cursor';
  cursor.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.8);border:2px solid white;pointer-events:none;z-index:999999;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:left 0.2s,top 0.2s;';
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => document.body.appendChild(cursor));
  document.addEventListener('mousemove', e => { cursor.style.left=e.clientX+'px'; cursor.style.top=e.clientY+'px'; });
});
```
Playwright mouse movements will update cursor automatically. Good.

